"「在线预览」用您本人的真实公开资料实时渲染首页效果（桌面 / 手机可切换）。点「选为草稿」只是暂存，不影响线上站点；确认后在下方点「发布草稿」才生效。新模板上架后会自动出现在这里，无需您做任何操作。": "\"Live Preview\" renders the homepage in real time with your own real public profile (switchable between desktop and mobile). \"Save as Draft\" only stages it — your live site is unaffected; it takes effect only when you tap \"Publish Draft\" below. New templates appear here automatically when released, with nothing for you to do.",
