"一套房子，是一个地址，也可能是您人生新篇章的开始。无论您正在寻找理想的家，还是担心做错决定，我都会陪您认真分析，让每一步选择更有底气。": "A home is an address — and it may also be the start of a new chapter in your life. Whether you're looking for your ideal home or worried about making the wrong decision, I'll think it through with you, so every step feels more confident.",
"一套数据，多套设计，一键切换。切换模板只换外观——您的文章、关注、链接地址和 AI 分身都不会变。": "One set of data, many designs, one-tap switching. Switching templates only changes the look — your articles, followers, links, and AI persona stay untouched.",
"一套数据，多套设计，一键切换。切换模板只换外观——您的文章、关注、链接地址和 AI 分身都不会变。 所有模板都用您的": "One dataset, many designs, switch in one click. Changing templates only changes the look — your articles, followers, link address and AI twin stay untouched. Every template renders with your",
