"一花一世界，一叶一菩提。": "One flower, one world; one leaf, one awakening.",
"一键入局，智享挥杆。智能组局、实时记分、实时球场地图，AI球童全程相伴，让每一杆都更精彩。无需下载 App，点击即可加入。": "Join in one tap and enjoy every swing. Smart grouping, live scoring, live course maps and an AI Caddie throughout — no app download needed, just tap to join.",
