"上传球会提供的坐标表（CSV/KML/GeoJSON）后，系统自动与现库逐洞逐字段比对生成差异清单；PDF/图片只登记、需人工锚点。任何差异都必须在下方逐项确认才会更新，系统绝不自动覆盖现库数据，确认后可回滚。": "After you upload the club-provided coordinate file (CSV/KML/GeoJSON), the system compares it hole by hole and field by field against the current database and generates a difference list. PDFs/images are registered only and need manual anchoring. Every difference must be confirmed item by item below before anything updates — the system never overwrites the current database automatically, and confirmed changes can be rolled back.",
"上传美国特许经营披露文件（FDD），自动生成带原文页码与摘录的中文加盟分析报告。文件默认仅本人可见，不公开、不入公共知识库。": "Upload a U.S. Franchise Disclosure Document (FDD) and automatically generate a Chinese franchise analysis report with source page numbers and excerpts. Files are visible only to you by default — never public, never added to the public knowledge base.",
"上传美国特许经营披露文件（FDD，PDF），系统自动抽取关键字段（加盟费、总投资、版税、广告基金、Item 19、期限等），生成 12 部分中文加盟分析报告，每项结论附原文页码与摘录；原文未披露的字段如实标注，绝不猜测填值。": "Upload a U.S. Franchise Disclosure Document (FDD, PDF). The system automatically extracts key fields (franchise fee, total investment, royalties, advertising fund, Item 19, term, and more) and generates a 12-part Chinese franchise analysis report, with every conclusion backed by source page numbers and excerpts. Fields the original doesn't disclose are marked as such — never guessed.",
